WEBVTT

00:00:02.013 --> 00:00:05.813
Hajimari no kaze yo

00:00:06.251 --> 00:00:10.085
Todoke Message

00:00:10.489 --> 00:00:19.420
'Itsudemo anato wo Shinjiteirukara'

00:00:20.198 --> 00:00:20.699
The Story of Saiunkoku

00:00:20.699 --> 00:00:28.740
The Story of Saiunkoku
Ano toki yume ni miteita
Sekai ni tatteirunoni

00:00:28.740 --> 00:00:29.069
The Story of Saiunkoku

00:00:29.274 --> 00:00:36.476
Miwatasu keshiki ni
Ashi wo sukoshi sukumase

00:00:36.848 --> 00:00:40.978
Dakedo ushiro furimukanaide

00:00:41.086 --> 00:00:45.079
Aruiteyuki koto
Kimeta kara

00:00:45.390 --> 00:00:49.486
Miageta sora
Nana iro no niji

00:00:49.661 --> 00:00:53.062
Anata mo mitemasuka?

00:00:53.398 --> 00:00:57.391
Hajimari no kaze yo

00:00:57.702 --> 00:01:01.536
Todoke Message

00:01:01.940 --> 00:01:10.040
Yumeni kakedashita senaka
Mimamoru kara

00:01:10.482 --> 00:01:14.418
Maiagaru kaze yo

00:01:14.819 --> 00:01:18.619
Hi no hikari matoi

00:01:19.090 --> 00:01:28.522
Jiyuu no tsubasa de
Tsuyoku tobitatou

00:01:32.037 --> 00:01:34.232
Though being angry
never did anyone any good...

00:01:34.306 --> 00:01:36.968
...on this morning,
Shurei Hong was furious.

00:01:37.709 --> 00:01:40.007
She had come to the palace
to tutor the king...

00:01:40.078 --> 00:01:43.047
...who seemed to have no interest
in government affairs. However...!

00:01:44.950 --> 00:01:46.918
What's so funny, Sho?

00:01:47.352 --> 00:01:51.049
Well, I was just thinking about
how well my plan is working.

00:01:51.456 --> 00:01:53.924
His Majesty has begun
to learn how to govern...

00:01:54.059 --> 00:01:56.926
...and even saved Consort Shurei
from danger.

00:01:57.729 --> 00:02:01.165
But that daughter from the Hong family
has certainly done well, hasn't she?

00:02:01.333 --> 00:02:04.427
However, to think that his
lack of motivation and ignorance...

00:02:04.502 --> 00:02:06.697
...were nothing more
than an act!

00:02:07.105 --> 00:02:09.471
The king is not
to be underestimated.

00:02:11.009 --> 00:02:12.806
You mustn't,
Consort Shurei!

00:02:12.877 --> 00:02:14.242
Well, if it isn't Lady Shurei.

00:02:14.312 --> 00:02:15.643
What is the problem?

00:02:15.780 --> 00:02:20.080
I request that I be released from
the Royal Harem immediately!

00:02:21.086 --> 00:02:23.577
And may I ask, what reason
do you have for such a request?

00:02:23.788 --> 00:02:28.157
That man isn't a stupid king at all!
He's just pretending to be a stupid king!

00:02:28.260 --> 00:02:30.990
- And?
- I'm going home!

00:02:31.396 --> 00:02:35.093
Thanks to you, Lady Shurei,
the king has changed.

00:02:35.800 --> 00:02:38.598
The palace is buzzing with talk
praising your efforts.

00:02:38.837 --> 00:02:41.931
However, if you leave now,
the king will lose interest...

00:02:42.140 --> 00:02:44.768
...and things will go back
to the way they were before.

00:02:47.212 --> 00:02:49.976
There's one other rumor
everyone is talking about.

00:02:50.148 --> 00:02:54.517
That the king and you have finally
begun spending nights together.

00:02:55.654 --> 00:02:57.315
B-But that's...!

00:02:57.389 --> 00:02:59.949
The reward we agreed to
is five hundred gold coins.

00:03:00.025 --> 00:03:04.086
I expect you to fulfill
your part of the deal, right to the end.

00:03:05.964 --> 00:03:10.635
All because I was blinded by those five
hundred gold coins. I hate being poor!

00:03:10.635 --> 00:03:15.595
Treasure Buried Is Treasure Wasted

00:03:16.308 --> 00:03:18.572
I never imagined
she would get so angry.

00:03:19.377 --> 00:03:21.845
And then to learn
she's my temporary wife.

00:03:23.548 --> 00:03:25.311
I'm crushed!

00:03:25.517 --> 00:03:28.418
Why were you pretending
to be stupid all this time?

00:03:28.720 --> 00:03:32.554
Because I thought that way Shurei
would pay more attention to me.

00:03:32.791 --> 00:03:35.089
Your Majesty, excuse me for what
I'm about to say.

00:03:35.160 --> 00:03:38.129
The truth is, you've slept
with women before, haven't you?

00:03:38.530 --> 00:03:41.090
- Might I add, quite a few?
- How did you know?!

00:03:41.399 --> 00:03:44.334
I can tell by the way you are
with Lady Shurei.

00:03:44.636 --> 00:03:46.604
Why have you been hiding it?

00:03:48.540 --> 00:03:52.943
I felt that if I were to have children,
it could lead to great trouble.

00:03:54.279 --> 00:03:55.940
As in, a civil war?

00:03:56.014 --> 00:04:00.781
I had always believed that someone
else would eventually take the throne.

00:04:02.220 --> 00:04:04.654
So in order to avoid the risk
of having children...

00:04:04.723 --> 00:04:07.453
...you allowed people
to believe that you like men?

00:04:09.761 --> 00:04:12.423
Certainly, before Lady Shurei came,
that was enough...

00:04:12.597 --> 00:04:17.330
...to keep those with any power from
sending their daughters to the palace.

00:04:19.704 --> 00:04:21.262
Then, Your Majesty.

00:04:22.006 --> 00:04:23.803
Have you ever been in love?

00:04:33.351 --> 00:04:35.819
I'll give you credit
for your taste in women.

00:04:35.987 --> 00:04:39.354
Now then,
since you've upset Lady Shurei...

00:04:39.557 --> 00:04:42.025
...you'll have to make up
for what you've done.

00:04:42.660 --> 00:04:45.185
I will be sure to find
the source of that poison.

00:04:45.830 --> 00:04:47.798
I'll answer to the trust
you've placed in me.

00:04:48.600 --> 00:04:51.398
I have accepted your purple iris,
after all.

00:04:52.470 --> 00:04:53.494
Thank you.

00:04:54.239 --> 00:04:58.403
The king is starting to look somewhat
like a real king. What a relief.

00:04:59.144 --> 00:05:01.169
It's still too soon
to be relieved.

00:05:01.613 --> 00:05:03.478
We can't waste
any time in finding...

00:05:03.548 --> 00:05:05.641
...the one who attempted
to poison Lady Shurei.

00:05:06.317 --> 00:05:10.481
Has Lady Shurei been advised not
to talk to anybody about this incident?

00:05:11.389 --> 00:05:14.654
If details were to leak out, it would cause
anxiety among the people of the palace.

00:05:14.726 --> 00:05:17.286
She won't tell anyone, regardless of
whether or not she's told to.

00:05:17.362 --> 00:05:19.853
Since it would only worry Shoka.

00:05:20.298 --> 00:05:22.095
Just who could have
done it?

00:05:22.934 --> 00:05:25.732
But if His Majesty Prince Seien
was still here...

00:05:25.804 --> 00:05:28.898
...that stupid king wouldn't need
to pretend to be stupid in the first place.

00:05:29.340 --> 00:05:30.739
Prince Seien...!

00:05:30.809 --> 00:05:34.870
If Prince Seien, the most outstanding
of all the princes were still here...

00:05:34.946 --> 00:05:37.676
...the fight for the throne
might never have happened.

00:05:38.349 --> 00:05:41.876
After he was exiled, we lost track
of his whereabouts. Well...

00:05:42.187 --> 00:05:44.951
...we don't even know
whether or not he's still alive.

00:05:47.926 --> 00:05:50.360
So that's what it means
to be "crafty".

00:05:53.598 --> 00:05:58.331
Even though I work within the palace,
I don't involve myself in politics.

00:05:58.670 --> 00:06:00.763
And I don't have relatives
that could...

00:06:00.839 --> 00:06:03.808
...politically take advantage
of your position as the king's consort.

00:06:05.176 --> 00:06:07.838
You knew about everything,
didn't you, father?

00:06:08.513 --> 00:06:13.678
I met Ryuki shortly after
I started working in the archives.

00:06:15.086 --> 00:06:18.715
A young boy turned up in the archives
covered in scratches and bruises.

00:06:19.958 --> 00:06:23.359
I was shocked,
and treated his wounds.

00:06:25.530 --> 00:06:28.090
He was a rather quiet
and solemn young boy.

00:06:28.800 --> 00:06:31.997
It was quite a long time
before I found out who this child was.

00:06:32.403 --> 00:06:36.032
But after a while he finally
started to talk a little.

00:06:36.708 --> 00:06:39.404
About his mother,
his brothers...

00:06:39.477 --> 00:06:41.445
...and about
the second eldest prince...

00:06:41.513 --> 00:06:44.243
...who was the only person
in the palace who loved him.

00:06:44.883 --> 00:06:48.751
Whenever he came to the archives,
he was always covered in scratches.

00:06:49.053 --> 00:06:53.422
Even after his mother passed away,
his brothers continued to beat him.

00:06:54.392 --> 00:06:58.795
All I could do for that small boy
was to be there to listen to him.

00:07:01.799 --> 00:07:02.925
Shurei.

00:07:03.334 --> 00:07:06.201
That man is of the
highest status...

00:07:06.304 --> 00:07:10.070
...and has a huge palace and everything
that would make people envy him.

00:07:10.375 --> 00:07:13.811
However, when it comes to the crucial,
fundamental things...

00:07:13.878 --> 00:07:18.178
...like the love of a mother, tender words,
and the touch of a soft caress...

00:07:18.516 --> 00:07:21.110
...none of this was ever
within his reach.

00:07:21.819 --> 00:07:23.446
But...

00:07:25.557 --> 00:07:27.286
...now you're here.

00:07:28.359 --> 00:07:30.793
You're a lot closer to him
than I could ever be.

00:07:31.195 --> 00:07:34.164
Shurei, please take care
of the king, Ryuki.

00:07:49.113 --> 00:07:51.479
It looks like Lady Shurei
noticed too.

00:07:51.983 --> 00:07:55.043
Oh, you're talking about
the king's stupid act.

00:07:56.654 --> 00:08:00.055
Still, it doesn't seem likely that
Lady Shurei will leave the palace now.

00:08:00.124 --> 00:08:01.148
Huh?

00:08:01.426 --> 00:08:05.328
It's Seiran. Speaking of which,
I wonder if he received a flower too.

00:08:05.430 --> 00:08:06.920
Who knows.

00:08:11.402 --> 00:08:12.869
Hi, Seiran.

00:08:15.239 --> 00:08:17.833
Have you heard the rumor the
ladies in waiting are talking about?

00:08:18.276 --> 00:08:20.836
You mean about Lady Shurei
and the king?

00:08:21.613 --> 00:08:23.706
Right. What do you
think about it?

00:08:23.815 --> 00:08:25.840
Well, if you must ask...

00:08:26.084 --> 00:08:28.882
...I think there's an eight or nine
out of ten chance nothing happened.

00:08:29.887 --> 00:08:33.482
So composed.
You're no fun to tease.

00:08:36.127 --> 00:08:41.531
Well... There must be a reason
for that confidence of yours, isn't there?

00:08:41.599 --> 00:08:43.999
Come to think of it, you've actually
been in a pretty tempting situation.

00:08:44.068 --> 00:08:47.333
Shoka, you, and Lady Shurei.
The three of you living together.

00:08:47.405 --> 00:08:49.635
The only one guarding the treasure
is that Shoka...

00:08:49.707 --> 00:08:51.504
...who, let's face it,
isn't much of a guard.

00:08:51.576 --> 00:08:54.807
In addition, you're a grown man
in his twenties.

00:09:01.119 --> 00:09:03.246
Come on, tell the truth.

00:09:03.521 --> 00:09:04.886
There's nothing going on.

00:09:15.033 --> 00:09:16.557
Advisor So!

00:09:18.102 --> 00:09:21.196
Oh, the young fellow from
the Ran family, and you're...!

00:09:26.544 --> 00:09:28.341
Very well.
Be my opponent.

00:09:28.413 --> 00:09:30.711
- Me?
- Yes, you.

00:09:30.782 --> 00:09:33.273
Advisor So used to be a commander
of unmatched prowess.

00:09:33.351 --> 00:09:36.684
He has fought in many battles and won
great honors as a military officer.

00:09:42.026 --> 00:09:46.986
The Story of Saiunkoku

00:09:57.108 --> 00:09:58.700
Good block!

00:09:58.776 --> 00:09:59.970
General So...!

00:10:04.382 --> 00:10:06.350
Your name's Seiran,
am I right?

00:10:06.684 --> 00:10:09.312
- Yes.
- How old are you?

00:10:09.554 --> 00:10:11.522
I will be twenty-one.

00:10:11.656 --> 00:10:13.453
Is that the truth?

00:10:13.524 --> 00:10:16.391
Thirteen years ago,
Shoka took you in, did he not?

00:10:17.462 --> 00:10:19.623
What were you doing
before that?

00:10:20.064 --> 00:10:22.032
W-Well...!

00:10:27.972 --> 00:10:29.405
You're pretty skilled.

00:10:29.474 --> 00:10:32.136
At first glance your style
appears to be self taught.

00:10:32.410 --> 00:10:34.970
But a style of swordsmanship
learned while young...

00:10:35.046 --> 00:10:37.241
...does not simply disappear
from one's memory.

00:10:37.348 --> 00:10:41.148
Your sword style is very similar
to the style of a young man I know.

00:10:41.686 --> 00:10:46.919
The young fellow over there must have
noticed it, too. He is a general, after all.

00:10:47.492 --> 00:10:50.825
I never thought I'd see
that style of swordsmanship again.

00:10:51.729 --> 00:10:56.029
Since I tutored Ryuki personally,
he would not know that sword style.

00:10:56.334 --> 00:11:01.169
That prince used to call me General So,
like you just did.

00:11:15.720 --> 00:11:17.984
Seiran!
Perfect timing.

00:11:18.422 --> 00:11:20.652
I made white radish cakes.

00:11:22.493 --> 00:11:25.053
The light, crisp texture of the outside
and the shredded radish...

00:11:25.129 --> 00:11:27.689
...make a perfect combination,
don't you think?

00:11:27.765 --> 00:11:28.959
Yes.

00:11:29.033 --> 00:11:31.968
I wanted the king to try them.

00:11:32.036 --> 00:11:35.199
I got so angry with him.
I wonder if he's okay.

00:11:35.973 --> 00:11:37.304
I'm sure he's fine.

00:11:37.375 --> 00:11:41.175
He must have his reasons for
pretending to be a stupid king, right?

00:11:41.512 --> 00:11:45.539
I do kind of understand
how it's not easy being a king.

00:11:46.450 --> 00:11:47.712
Indeed.

00:11:51.189 --> 00:11:52.713
Hey, Seiran.

00:11:53.024 --> 00:11:53.991
Yes?

00:11:54.125 --> 00:11:57.060
Are you by any chance being harassed
in the Left Urin Army?

00:11:57.395 --> 00:12:00.262
You have outstanding skills,
and a pretty face.

00:12:00.331 --> 00:12:02.526
Come to think of it, being singled out
is more than likely.

00:12:02.600 --> 00:12:05.262
Lady Shurei.
Nothing like that is going on.

00:12:05.570 --> 00:12:09.404
Then what is it?
What is it that's troubling you?

00:12:10.208 --> 00:12:13.075
I just can't win
against you, can I?

00:12:15.947 --> 00:12:18.415
If anything's bothering you,
tell me, okay?

00:12:18.783 --> 00:12:21.251
I'm always coming to you with
my complaints, Seiran...

00:12:21.319 --> 00:12:23.446
...so it's only
fair you do the same.

00:12:24.288 --> 00:12:26.085
But that'll probably never happen.

00:12:26.157 --> 00:12:29.024
You have never even once
done anything like that.

00:12:29.327 --> 00:12:33.661
Honestly, how can I ever repay you
for all the things you've done for me?

00:12:37.168 --> 00:12:39.295
You've already repaid me,
long ago.

00:12:40.338 --> 00:12:44.434
Whenever I see you being yourself,
it always gives me more strength.

00:12:45.776 --> 00:12:48.244
- Really?
- Really.

00:12:49.146 --> 00:12:52.775
But Seiran, you always seem to be
on the wrong end of a deal.

00:12:53.117 --> 00:12:56.814
- Wrong end of a deal?
- You always put others before yourself.

00:12:57.188 --> 00:12:58.849
It's not like that.

00:12:58.923 --> 00:13:03.485
You and Shoka are very important
to me, so I always think of you first.

00:13:04.095 --> 00:13:05.722
That's exactly what I mean!

00:13:11.769 --> 00:13:13.669
For some reason,
whenever I see you, Seiran...

00:13:13.738 --> 00:13:16.536
...the phrase, "Treasure buried
is treasure wasted" comes to mind.

00:13:16.607 --> 00:13:19.576
You don't realize how special you are,
do you, Seiran?

00:13:20.645 --> 00:13:25.776
I'm very happy having you by my side,
but I often think your talent is wasted.

00:13:26.484 --> 00:13:29.976
And I feel that maybe there will
come a day when you'll go far away.

00:13:32.456 --> 00:13:34.424
I'll always be by your side.

00:13:45.269 --> 00:13:48.295
Good lord. Why hold a martial arts
tournament so suddenly?

00:13:49.073 --> 00:13:51.405
Will you please either
eat or speak?

00:13:51.609 --> 00:13:53.839
What is Advisor So thinking?

00:13:54.211 --> 00:13:57.112
And you've been put in charge of
handling the tournament, have you?

00:13:57.214 --> 00:13:58.841
You'll have to make
an appearance too, you know.

00:13:58.916 --> 00:14:00.315
What?!

00:14:02.386 --> 00:14:04.251
- Wh-What's wrong?
- That's it.

00:14:04.322 --> 00:14:06.847
This might be a plan
to draw out the Black Wolf.

00:14:07.825 --> 00:14:09.315
The Black Wolf?

00:14:09.393 --> 00:14:13.261
It's said that he led a group of assassins
known as the Wolves of Wind...

00:14:13.831 --> 00:14:16.629
...a loyal and trusted group
of the former king.

00:14:17.134 --> 00:14:20.160
He's a legendary assassin
of unmatched talent.

00:14:22.039 --> 00:14:24.007
Rumor has it he's still alive...

00:14:24.075 --> 00:14:26.270
...and it's even possible that he still
works within the palace.

00:14:26.344 --> 00:14:28.209
Don't you think
the advisor is trying...

00:14:28.279 --> 00:14:30.611
...to use the martial arts tournament
to lure him out?

00:14:31.148 --> 00:14:33.116
Advisor So!

00:14:33.751 --> 00:14:37.209
But the guy's not going to expose
his identity that easily.

00:14:37.888 --> 00:14:39.378
The Black Wolf.

00:14:39.590 --> 00:14:44.755
You're right. The Black Wolf is probably
the person you least suspect.

00:14:48.099 --> 00:14:51.068
You are to enter the tournament
taking place the day after tomorrow.

00:14:51.135 --> 00:14:53.763
- But I...!
- Make sure you give it your best.

00:15:00.778 --> 00:15:02.905
The spring makes my nose so itchy.

00:15:03.547 --> 00:15:04.844
Shoka.

00:15:05.149 --> 00:15:07.674
Oh, hello, Koyu.
What can I do for you?

00:15:08.419 --> 00:15:13.356
I've been appointed to preside over
the tournament the day after tomorrow.

00:15:13.457 --> 00:15:15.755
- Well now!
- So...

00:15:16.394 --> 00:15:19.090
...will you please help me
prepare my speech?!

00:15:19.263 --> 00:15:21.697
I think it'll be better if you come up
with it yourself.

00:15:22.299 --> 00:15:25.200
But I'll gladly
assist with serving the tea.

00:15:52.363 --> 00:15:53.830
Koyu!

00:15:54.865 --> 00:15:57.333
- What is it?
- That can't be good!

00:15:59.537 --> 00:16:02.370
I guess you're right.
How could I have let Shoka serve tea?

00:16:02.440 --> 00:16:05.273
That's not what I'm talking about.
Father's tea tastes awful!

00:16:09.180 --> 00:16:10.977
- Please allow me.
- Uh...!

00:16:11.182 --> 00:16:14.242
It gives me great pleasure, on a blessed
day such as today, under clear skies...

00:16:14.318 --> 00:16:15.979
...and in the full glory of spring...

00:16:16.053 --> 00:16:18.021
...to present this
wonderful and joyous event...

00:16:18.089 --> 00:16:20.353
...and share in the happiness
it brings us all.

00:16:21.425 --> 00:16:23.518
You'd think we were having
a wedding ceremony.

00:16:23.594 --> 00:16:25.858
He did have a speech prepared...

00:16:25.930 --> 00:16:28.558
...but it looks like he's so nervous
he can't even read what he's written.

00:16:29.133 --> 00:16:31.567
Koyu Ri!
Get this started, already!

00:16:31.635 --> 00:16:36.971
Yes, sir! Without further ado, let the
first Martial Arts Tournament begin!

00:16:37.408 --> 00:16:39.000
Today your rank is immaterial...

00:16:39.076 --> 00:16:42.102
...as you will be competing
based on individual skill.

00:16:42.179 --> 00:16:45.012
The winner will be awarded
one hundred gold coins.

00:16:47.585 --> 00:16:49.348
O-One hundred gold coins.

00:16:51.055 --> 00:16:52.784
I wanna enter too.

00:16:53.090 --> 00:16:56.287
All right, then. I'll enter and win
the reward for you, Shurei.

00:16:56.360 --> 00:16:57.850
Really?!

00:16:57.928 --> 00:17:01.125
Actually, I could simply give you
as much money as you want...

00:17:01.565 --> 00:17:03.931
...but I know you wouldn't
accept it that way.

00:17:05.269 --> 00:17:09.103
With this, can you forgive me
for deceiving you?

00:17:10.574 --> 00:17:14.374
You're already forgiven. But do your
best to win that reward money, okay!

00:17:16.213 --> 00:17:17.339
Yeah.

00:17:18.916 --> 00:17:21.407
I never expected the king
to compete as well.

00:17:21.485 --> 00:17:24.113
And he's made it
through to the semifinals, no less.

00:17:24.655 --> 00:17:28.785
Well, he was my student after all.
He won't be defeated that easily.

00:17:29.193 --> 00:17:31.388
And now, we will begin
our semifinals!

00:17:32.596 --> 00:17:35.156
Shuei Ran versus Bunshin Son.

00:17:38.435 --> 00:17:39.493
Begin!

00:17:54.251 --> 00:17:56.048
Sh-Shuei Ran.

00:17:58.923 --> 00:18:01.483
General Ran certainly is popular
with the women, isn't he?

00:18:01.992 --> 00:18:03.960
Yes, the real Shuei Ran is.

00:18:04.962 --> 00:18:09.092
The next match is,
Ryuki Shi versus Seiran Si!

00:18:09.767 --> 00:18:12.201
Although written in different characters,
Ryuki and Seiran...

00:18:12.269 --> 00:18:16.501
...have the same "Shi" for their
family name. Who should I cheer for?

00:18:17.675 --> 00:18:21.941
But no matter who wins, my family
will still get the one hundred gold coins!

00:18:38.362 --> 00:18:39.329
Begin!

00:18:53.077 --> 00:18:54.135
This style...!

00:18:54.445 --> 00:18:57.039
Why does Ryuki appear distracted?

00:18:58.449 --> 00:19:02.977
This sword style is...
Could it be? No, that's not possible.

00:19:03.988 --> 00:19:05.956
Seiran! Are you...?!

00:19:25.476 --> 00:19:26.841
Ryuki Shi!

00:19:31.282 --> 00:19:32.613
Congratulations.

00:19:35.586 --> 00:19:36.848
What's wrong?

00:19:38.255 --> 00:19:39.722
Nothing.

00:19:45.162 --> 00:19:47.824
So in the end,
General Ran won it all.

00:19:47.898 --> 00:19:49.126
Sorry.

00:19:50.868 --> 00:19:52.893
It's okay.
But Ryuki, what's the matter?

00:19:52.970 --> 00:19:55.598
You weren't focused
on the final match at all.

00:20:04.348 --> 00:20:05.406
Ryuki?

00:20:08.052 --> 00:20:09.212
Excuse me.

00:20:11.522 --> 00:20:12.716
What's going on?

00:20:15.793 --> 00:20:17.260
Seiran!

00:20:21.699 --> 00:20:24.497
I had an older brother
whom I loved very much.

00:20:25.536 --> 00:20:28.733
When I was all alone,
he would always play with me.

00:20:29.773 --> 00:20:33.834
Brother Seien was the only one
who would always be kind to me.

00:20:35.546 --> 00:20:38.743
I loved that older brother
more than anyone.

00:20:39.483 --> 00:20:42.247
He always shielded me
with his broad back.

00:20:44.121 --> 00:20:47.181
I didn't cry, even when my mother
and other brothers died.

00:20:48.025 --> 00:20:52.428
But when Brother Seien left,
I cried.

00:20:53.197 --> 00:20:55.563
The reason I ignored
my duties to govern...

00:20:55.632 --> 00:20:57.964
...was because I was always
waiting for someone to say...

00:20:58.669 --> 00:21:00.762
..."Bring back Prince Seien"!

00:21:02.272 --> 00:21:05.264
And to think he was
this close to me!

00:21:05.409 --> 00:21:07.377
I am not your brother.

00:21:08.645 --> 00:21:11.614
But, if I were your brother,
I would likely say this.

00:21:12.149 --> 00:21:14.709
Abandon that stupid idea
of yours at once.

00:21:16.653 --> 00:21:20.350
The court has already begun to operate
with you at its center.

00:21:20.457 --> 00:21:23.984
- Prince Seien is no longer needed.
- That's not true!

00:21:24.128 --> 00:21:29.122
Your brother would be happy seeing you
become more like a ruler each day.

00:21:30.667 --> 00:21:33.158
As long as he could support you
from the shadows.

00:21:34.471 --> 00:21:37.406
It must pain him not
to be able to reveal his identity...

00:21:37.541 --> 00:21:39.600
...but you've realized his presence,
haven't you?

00:21:40.177 --> 00:21:42.907
That alone is enough
to make him very happy.

00:21:52.156 --> 00:21:53.487
Seien!

00:21:54.191 --> 00:21:58.992
No way! That's...
That's not enough for me!

00:22:01.331 --> 00:22:03.697
Do you think it's acceptable
to say something like that?

00:22:03.767 --> 00:22:06.167
That kinda talk
will only cause trouble again.

00:22:07.004 --> 00:22:10.838
If that happened, Prince Seien,
who's close by, might have to flee.

00:22:12.176 --> 00:22:13.803
Flee?

00:22:13.877 --> 00:22:17.711
In other words, he'll leave you again.
Is that all right with you?

00:22:18.081 --> 00:22:19.548
No way!

00:22:20.818 --> 00:22:24.015
Then accept the fact he's somewhere
and leave it at that.

00:22:32.863 --> 00:22:34.990
You're a very good liar, too.

00:22:39.236 --> 00:22:40.863
What's the matter?

00:22:42.673 --> 00:22:44.300
Were you fighting?

00:22:44.641 --> 00:22:49.044
It's a shame that neither of you won,
but I'm not worried about the reward.

00:22:49.913 --> 00:22:51.141
- What is it?
- Nothing.

00:22:51.215 --> 00:22:55.208
Nothing at all.
Just seeing you gives me great joy.

00:22:55.519 --> 00:22:58.044
That kinda sounds like something
Seiran would say.

00:23:03.460 --> 00:23:05.655
Don't tell me these two...

00:23:06.797 --> 00:23:08.765
...are dating each other?

00:23:11.768 --> 00:23:12.962
What's wrong?

00:23:13.704 --> 00:23:15.035
N-Nothing at all!

00:23:15.105 --> 00:23:17.232
Lady Shurei, if there's
something worrying you...!

00:23:17.307 --> 00:23:19.775
No, I... I'll just be going
to my room, okay?

00:23:20.611 --> 00:23:22.704
- Hey! Shurei!
- Lady Shurei!

00:23:22.779 --> 00:23:25.145
- Sorry, I didn't mean to bother you.
- Wait a minute! Lady Shurei!

00:23:25.215 --> 00:23:27.445
- Please go ahead! Go ahead!
- Shurei!

00:23:27.518 --> 00:23:29.418
She's certainly acting strange.

00:23:30.554 --> 00:23:35.651
Itsumo sugoku jiyu na anata ha ima

00:23:35.859 --> 00:23:42.196
Kono ame no naka donna
Yume wo oikaketeiruno

00:23:42.499 --> 00:23:47.459
Dokokade kodoku to tatakainagara

00:23:47.671 --> 00:23:52.768
Namida mo gaman shiterundarou

00:23:53.777 --> 00:23:58.180
Hitori demo daijobu to

00:23:59.716 --> 00:24:04.847
Anata mo watashi to onaji

00:24:05.622 --> 00:24:16.191
Tomawari bakari dakedo
Nazeka kono michi ga suki de

00:24:17.067 --> 00:24:22.664
Shiawase da toka ureshii toki ha

00:24:23.073 --> 00:24:28.136
Anata no koto wo omoidasu kara

00:24:29.012 --> 00:24:34.575
Iroazayaka na kisetsu ha kitto

00:24:34.952 --> 00:24:41.824
Kono omoi todoketekureru

00:24:45.128 --> 00:24:45.529
Next Episode

00:24:45.529 --> 00:24:48.098
Next Episode
